RREFL HALF 0 10k
RISO VR POS 10k
RH OUT SEN 1176000
RL SEN 0 10100
XMAIN POS SEN MON 0 CMP LM2903B
XHOLD FB HALF MON 0 HOLD LM2903B
RRESET HOLD POS 1000
RFBH CMP FB 2000000
RFBL FB 0 1000000
RPU MON CMP 100k
RLED MON L1 3650
DLED1 L1 L2 LED
DLED2 L2 LD LED
VLED LD CMP 0
.model LED D IS=1e-20 N=1.3 RS=10
